THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

This dataset aggregates factual metadata collected from third-party sources.
Reuse of those portions remains subject to the respective source terms,
recorded per record in exports/provenance.jsonl and summarized in
exports/sources.jsonl. No upstream plot synopsis, character biography or
episode summary is included in any release artifact; those third-party texts
are removed rather than paraphrased. See LICENSE_AUDIT.md for the per-artifact
inventory and the limits of this license.

Source terms, in brief:

  - Wikidata:   CC0-1.0 (public domain) — https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  - Kitsu:      public API; terms grant no redistribution — https://kitsu.io
  - AniList:    © respective rights holders; public API without auth
  - Shikimori:  license unspecified — recorded as license-uncertain
  - ANN:        copyrighted; limited factual fields, license-uncertain

No license or permission is asserted for content whose status was not
verified. If any included source content is not lawfully reusable, contact
the maintainers and it will be removed on request.